{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1449182-w20-beast-courts-double-auspice-double-renown","id":1449182,"title":"W20 Beast Courts: Double Auspice, Double Renown?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-05-21T04:38:50-07:00","id":1449182,"title":"W20 Beast Courts: Double Auspice, Double Renown?","content":"Hello everybody,<br /> <br /> so I recently came around to purchasing and reading W20 Changing Breeds. Love the Book and the different Changing Breeds but one thing I do not understand entirely, I think.<br /> <br /> So as I understand it Shapeshifters that belong to the Beast Courts have two Auspices. One specific to their kind and one that describes their duties in the Court and the Sentai.<br /> <br /> For example:<br /> <br /> You can have a Kitsune Shinju (Metis) Doshi Mirror or a Hakken Homid Ahroun Fist.<br /> <br /> Do they only &quot;collect&quot; renown for their Beast Court Auspice or for their &quot;racial&quot; Auspice too? So does one have too keep track of two kinds of renown per charakter?<br /> <br /> In the Passages concerning the Kitsune, at least in the german version that I own, it is outlined that they only collect one of the two. If they do not belong to the Beast Courts they collect the three kinds of Kitsune Renown &quot;Chie, Toku and Kagayaki&quot; if they belong to the Beast Courts they collect Renown according to their Court Auspice.<br /> <br /> Since Gifts are bound to Rank and the Hengeyokai basically have access to two lists of Auspice Gifts do they have to collect Renown for both auspices or does only their Court Rank matter? Culturally that does not seem sound, since for example the Hakken or the Same-Bito revere other Renown than their Counterparts among the Garou and the Rokea, I think.<br /> <br /> Can a Rank 2 Hakken Ahroun Fist for example &quot;purchase&quot; Rank 2 Gifts from the Ahroun List AND the Fist List?<br /> <br /> Sorry if my train of thought seems a bit confused. I hope my question was clear.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25379-spacedigger","name":"Spacedigger","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-21T05:54:42-07:00","id":1449184,"title":"","content":"I\u2019ll say both","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-21T12:58:14-07:00","id":1449206,"title":"","content":"If they belong to the Beast Courts, they count as their Beast Courts rank in both auspices, and they will indeed get to purchase Gifts of their own auspice or otherwise as if they were of that rank. If not, it's just in their breed auspice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-05-21T21:02:22-07:00","id":1449226,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1449182-w20-beast-courts-double-auspice-double-renown?p=1449206#post1449206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they belong to the Beast Courts, they count as their Beast Courts rank in both auspices, and they will indeed get to purchase Gifts of their own auspice or otherwise as if they were of that rank. If not, it's just in their breed auspice.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for the clarification <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25379-spacedigger","name":"Spacedigger","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}